Respects every constraint (key, not_null, refs, check, sorted). Uses stats only 
to                                                                              pick realistic ranges/vocabularies so filters hit. Mixes in NULLs, duplicates an
d                                                                               ties, empty and 1-row tables, case/space variants, weird Unicode (ß, ﬁ, emoji,
combining marks), NUM scale variants (1.0 vs 1.00), zeros (to make DIV error),
boundary dates, and the programs' own literals with +-1 neighbours.
"""
import datetime
